{%- comment -%}
  Mini Cart — 仅在 test.liquid (Collection pages custom) 内使用。
  通过 sections/mini-cart.liquid 走 Section Rendering API 拿到刷新后的 HTML。

  Count and list source:
    All cart lines whose product belongs to the free-swatches collection.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign max_items = 20 -%}

{%- assign visible_items_count = 0 -%}
{%- assign first_section_item = nil -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Use one source of truth for the count, thumbnails, and checkout behavior:
  every cart line whose product belongs to the free-swatches collection.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign non_swatch_qty = 0 -%}
{%- for item in cart.items -%}
  {%- assign item_collection_handles = item.product.collections | map: 'handle' -%}
  {%- if item_collection_handles contains 'free-swatches' -%}
    {%- assign visible_items_count = visible_items_count | plus: 1 -%}
    {%- if first_section_item == nil -%}
      {%- assign first_section_item = item -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign non_swatch_qty = non_swatch_qty | plus: item.quantity -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Checkout 跳转：不把 /checkout 写进 href —— 否则会被第三方 app 的 a[href*="checkout"] 选择器命中，
  在按钮旁注入折扣码/Total 组件。改为仅在"仅小样"(non_swatch_qty == 0) 时给按钮打 data 标记，
  由 test.liquid 的点击委托拦截并 window.location 跳 /checkout；否则 <a> 原生跳购物车页。
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} 列表两端箭头：>8 件时（即开始溢出滚动）用深色（active）版本，否则用默认浅色版本 {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if visible_items_count > 8 -%}
  {%- assign nav_prev_src = 'mini-cart-left-arrow-active.png' -%}
  {%- assign nav_next_src = 'mini-cart-right-arrow-active.png' -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign nav_prev_src = 'mini-cart-left-arrow.png' -%}
  {%- assign nav_next_src = 'mini-cart-right-arrow.png' -%}
{%- endif -%}

<aside
  class="mini-cart mini-cart--free-swatches{% if visible_items_count == 0 %} mini-cart--hidden{% endif %}"
  data-mini-cart
  aria-label="Sample cart">
  <div class="mini-cart__expanded" data-mini-cart-expanded>
    <header class="mini-cart__header">
      <h3 class="mini-cart__title">
        Order Free Swatches (<span data-mini-cart-count>{{ visible_items_count }}</span>/{{ max_items }})
      </h3>
      <p class="mini-cart__perk-reminder"><strong>$9.99</strong> shipping — get a <strong>$10</strong> coupon + unlock up to <strong>29% off</strong></p>
      <button type="button" class="mini-cart__btn mini-cart__collapse-btn" data-mini-cart-collapse aria-label="Collapse">
        <img
          class="mini-cart__collapse-icon mini-cart__collapse-icon--desktop"
          src="{{ 'mini-cart-close.png' | asset_url }}"
          alt=""
          width="13"
          height="13" />
        <img
          class="mini-cart__collapse-icon mini-cart__collapse-icon--mobile"
          src="{{ 'mini-cart-arrow-bottom-mobile.png' | asset_url }}"
          alt=""
          width="12"
          height="8" />
      </button>
    </header>
    <div class="mini-cart__split"></div>
    <div class="mini-cart__list-wrap">
      <button type="button" class="mini-cart__btn mini-cart__nav mini-cart__nav--prev" data-mini-cart-prev aria-label="Previous">
          <img
            src="{{ nav_prev_src | asset_url }}"
            alt=""
            width="8px"
            height="12px" />
      </button>
      <ul class="mini-cart__list" data-mini-cart-list role="list">
        {%- for item in cart.items -%}
          {%- assign item_collection_handles = item.product.collections | map: 'handle' -%}
          {%- if item_collection_handles contains 'free-swatches' -%}
            <li class="mini-cart__item"
                data-mini-cart-item
                data-variant-id="{{ item.variant_id }}"
                data-line-key="{{ item.key }}">
              <div class="mini-cart__item-image" aria-hidden="true">
                <img
                  src="{{ item.product.featured_media | image_url: width: 64 }}"
                  alt=""
                  width="64px"
                  height="64px" />
              </div>
              <button type="button"
                      class="mini-cart__btn mini-cart__item-remove"
                      data-mini-cart-remove
                      aria-label="Remove {{ item.product.title | escape }}">
                <img
                  src="{{ 'mini-cart-remove.png' | asset_url }}"
                  alt=""
                  width="20px"
                  height="20px" />
              </button>
            </li>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
      <button type="button" class="mini-cart__btn mini-cart__nav mini-cart__nav--next" data-mini-cart-next aria-label="Next">
        <img
          src="{{ nav_next_src | asset_url }}"
          alt=""
          width="8px"
          height="12px" />
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mini-cart__collapsed" data-mini-cart-collapsed hidden>
    <span class="mini-cart__collapsed-title">
      Order Swatches (<span data-mini-cart-count>{{ visible_items_count }}</span>/{{ max_items }})
    </span>
    <button type="button" class="mini-cart__btn mini-cart__expand-btn" data-mini-cart-expand aria-label="Expand">
      <img
        class="mini-cart__expand-icon mini-cart__expand-icon--desktop"
        src="{{ 'mini-cart-left-arrow.png' | asset_url }}"
        alt=""
        width="8"
        height="12" />
      <img
        class="mini-cart__expand-icon mini-cart__expand-icon--mobile"
        src="{{ 'mini-cart-arrow-top-mobile.png' | asset_url }}"
        alt=""
        width="12"
        height="8" />
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="mini-cart__cart-action" data-mini-cart-cart-action>
    {%- comment -%} 展开态：购物车 icon + Cart 按钮 {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="mini-cart__cart-action-expanded" data-mini-cart-cart-expanded>
      <span class="mini-cart__cart-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <img
          src="{{ 'mini-cart-logo.svg' | asset_url }}"
          alt=""
          width="32px"
          height="32px" />
      </span>
      <a class="mini-cart__btn mini-cart__cart-btn"
         href="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
         {% if non_swatch_qty == 0 %}data-checkout-only-swatches{% endif %}>
        Checkout
      </a>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} 收起态：(X/20) 计数 + 第一个色卡（仅展示，无 ⊖） {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="mini-cart__cart-action-collapsed" data-mini-cart-cart-collapsed hidden>
      <span class="mini-cart__cart-collapsed-count">
        (<span data-mini-cart-count>{{ visible_items_count }}</span>/{{ max_items }})
      </span>
      {%- if first_section_item -%}
        <div class="mini-cart__cart-collapsed-item" aria-hidden="true">
          <img
            src="{{ first_section_item.product.featured_media | image_url: width: 64 }}"
            alt=""
            width="64px"
            height="64px" />
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>
